    "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">&nbsp;Pysical Therapist Assistant&nbsp; <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em>Full-Time</em>&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">COTA&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em>Full- Time</em>&nbsp;</span></span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">Speech <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><em>Full-Time</em></span> split between two locations </span></strong></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">PT&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <em><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Full-time</span>&nbsp;</em></span></strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Competitive rates, &amp; a flexible schedule are offered!</span></strong></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">PRN hours are also available</span></strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">Our approach is patient-centered. With specialty practitioners, therapists, nurses, and staff, we have some of the best programs in the area and we would love for you to join our team!</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">Responsibilities:</span></strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Identify and meet patients&rsquo; goals and needs</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Offer cost-effective treatments that help improve clients&rsquo; motion and mobility</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Reduce the need for medications and provide alternatives to surgery</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Develop care plans using a variety of treatment techniques</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Create fitness- and wellness-oriented programs tailored to patients&rsquo; specific needs</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Provide quality, personalized and evidence-based care, and proven interventions</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Motivate patients during treatment to help them function optimally</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Promote clients&rsquo; healthy lifestyle by improving strength, flexibility, balance, and coordination</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Consult and practice with other health professionals</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Evaluate effects and monitor and communicate progress</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Document patient care services</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">Skills:</span></strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Proven work experience/background as a physical therapist/assistant</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Intensive education and clinical expertise</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Ability to manage patients with different types of personalities</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Current knowledge of treatment practices</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Drive to continually learn and grow</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Professional behavior</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Excellent interpersonal communication skills</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Valid license to practice physical therapy</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Associate degree for an assistant position</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">Career Advantages:</span></strong></p>\n<ul type=\"disc\">\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Practice in an environment built on integrity and progressive, ethical care</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">In-House Therapy Dept- NOT CONTRACTED!</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Competitive pay rates, benefits, and flexible work schedule</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Clinical expertise and training available</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Net Health Electronic documentation system</span></li>\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"color: #595959; mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list .5in; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">Work collaboratively with a supportive team of therapists and nursing staff</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; background: white;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Sans',sans-serif; color: #424242;\">We are looking for professional Occupational&nbsp; Therapist Assistants who are committed to our values and to our mission of striving to improve health and enrich lives through partnership, compassion and acts of kindness, every person, every time. If you want to work in a rewarding environment with the opportunity for personal and professional growth, come join our team</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: 'Times New Roman',serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
