    "description": "<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #595959; margin: 0px; margin-block-end: 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Waterbury Center for Nursing and Rehab is currently recruiting for a FULL TIME Physical Therapist for their IN-HOUSE skilled nursing facility in Waterbury, CT.</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Located at 177 Whitewood Rd, Waterbury, CT 06708</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #595959; margin: 0px; margin-block-end: 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\">We place a high importance on attracting dynamic healthcare professionals who share a philosophy of quality patient/clinical care in a welcoming, respectful, and cohesive team environment.</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #595959; margin: 0px; margin-block-end: 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Responsibilities:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Evaluate, plan and administer treatment to residents and patients with temporary or long term disabilities to relieve pain, restore or improve function, and promote healing</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Assure all treatment is delivered in accordance with an established plan of care</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Provide quality, personalized and evidence-based care and proven intervention to patients with a variety of personalities</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Offer cost-effective treatments that help improve clients&rsquo; motion and mobility</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Provide clinical support and instruct patients, families, and caregivers; consult with other health professionals</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Monitor patient response to treatment intervention</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Complete required forms and documentation in accordance with company policy and state/federal regulations</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.5; color: #595959; margin: 0px; margin-block-end: 0.75rem; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: bold;\">Career Advantages:</span></p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: inherit; color: #595959; font-family: 'Indeed Sans', 'Noto Sans', 'Helvetica Neue', Helvetica, Arial, 'Liberation Sans', Roboto, Noto, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; background-color: #ffffff; margin-bottom: 0.625rem !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Rare in-house opportunity, yet have the support of a rehab company</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Execellent Benefits and Pay!</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Practice in an environment built on integrity and progressive, ethical care</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Clinical expertise, training and mentoring available</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Electronic documentation system</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: inherit; font-size: 0.875rem; list-style: inside disc !important;\">Work collaboratively with a supportive team of therapists and nursing staff</li>\n</ul>",
